WEBVTT

00:08:29.658 --> 00:08:32.753
And the curators did something
that usually doesn't happen --

00:08:32.777 --> 00:08:33.927
they improvised.

00:08:34.554 --> 00:08:36.917
They drew four lines,
and put in two words:

00:08:37.515 --> 00:08:38.703
"I belong."

00:08:38.727 --> 00:08:40.299
So you come out of this exhibit,

00:08:40.323 --> 00:08:42.371
and you can take a picture in front of it.

00:08:42.395 --> 00:08:44.815
I can't tell you the impact
that has on people --

00:08:44.839 --> 00:08:47.092
I watched people come out of this,

00:08:47.116 --> 00:08:49.537
and some of them sat
in front of that picture,

00:08:49.561 --> 00:08:52.490
took a picture, and they had
a great, big grin on their face,

00:08:52.514 --> 00:08:54.580
and some people just had tears.

00:08:55.173 --> 00:08:57.236
Some people hugged
and brought in strangers,

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.997
others brought in their family.